    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSuperb 2 bed end terrace house\nUpgraded modern kitchen\nLarge living room to rear with French doors to rear garden\n2 large double bedrooms with built in wardrobes\nLarge family bathroom\nMaintenance free stone façade tastefully decorated throughout.\nOil fired central heating and double-glazed PVC windows\nPrivate rear garden with gate to a secure parking area.\nCountry village location with easy access to M1 & M2 Motorways and surrounding towns of Ashbourne and Swords.\n\nWelcome to 1 Old Schoolyard, Oldtown, Co. Dublin, a beautifully presented two-bedroom end-terrace residence offering an exceptional blend of modern comfort, stylish interiors, and village charm. Tastefully decorated throughout and finished with an attractive maintenance-free stone façade, this superb home is ideally suited to first-time buyers, downsizers, or those seeking a turnkey property in a peaceful yet highly accessible location. Upon entering, prospective purchasers are immediately greeted by a bright and welcoming atmosphere. The accommodation has been thoughtfully upgraded and maintained to a high standard, with a contemporary fitted kitchen providing both style and practicality for modern living. To the rear of the property, a generously proportioned living room offers an inviting space for relaxation and entertaining, with elegant French doors opening directly onto the private rear garden, seamlessly connecting indoor and outdoor living.\nUpstairs, the property boasts two spacious double bedrooms, both benefiting from built-in wardrobes and ample natural light. A large family bathroom serves the accommodation and is finished to a high standard, complementing the home's overall sense of comfort and quality. Externally, the private rear garden provides a secure and low-maintenance outdoor retreat, perfect for enjoying sunny afternoons or al fresco dining. A rear gate offers direct access to a secure parking area, adding further convenience for residents. Additional features include oil-fired central heating, double-glazed PVC windows, and excellent energy efficiency throughout, ensuring year-round comfort.\nSituated in the heart of the picturesque village of Oldtown, this wonderful home enjoys a peaceful country setting while remaining within easy reach of the M1 and M2 motorways. The thriving towns of Ashbourne and Swords are both just a short drive away, providing an extensive range of shopping, dining, leisure, and transport amenities. This enviable location offers the perfect balance of rural tranquillity and commuter convenience.\n1 Old Schoolyard represents a rare opportunity to acquire a stylish, move-in-ready home in one of North County Dublin's most charming village settings. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.85m x 3.73m\nwith wooden flooring\n\nKitchen - 2.85m x 3.32m\nwith tiled flooring, upgraded modern white kitchen with built in appliances.\n\nDining area - 3.82m x 2.74m\nwith wooden flooring, understairs store room\n\nLiving area - 4.8m x 3.23m\nwith wooden flooring, open fire place with solid hearth, french doors to rear, built in TV stand\n\nBedroom One - 4.8m x 2.83m\nwith laminate flooring, built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom Two - 4.12m x 3.23m\nwith laminate floorin and built in wardrobes\n\nBathroom - 2.57m x 2.38m\nwith wooden flooring, wc, whb and bath with shower over.\n\n"
      },
